" taskman v0.0.0              │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                    Welcome to taskman                                    "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                  Press ctrl+a P to add a project: a folder you work in.                  "
"                             │  Connect a tracker (Jira, Linear, GitHub Issues or Local files) for tickets, each in its "
"      ╭ Settings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮      "
"      │ GENERAL                      │ New account                                                               │      "
"      │  Prefix and updates   notify │ Add the Jira account this project should use.                             │      "
"      │                              │ taskman never saves your token in its files, only where to read it from.  │      "
"      │ PROJECTS                     │                                                                           │      "
"      │  + new project               │ Provider   ‹ Jira ›                                                       │      "
"      │                              │            ←/→ to change                                                  │      "
"      │ ACCOUNTS                     │ Site       acme.atlassian.net                                             │      "
"      │▸ + new account               │            where to test the token, like your-site.atlassian.net          │      "
"      │                              │ Email      dana@example.com                                               │      "
"      │                              │            the email you sign in to Atlassian with                        │      "
"      │                              │ Keep in    ‹ Variable or command ›                                        │      "
"      │                              │            ←/→: your macOS Keychain, or a variable or command of yours    │      "
"      │                              │ Read from  env:JIRA_API_TOKEN                                             │      "
"      │                              │            env:JIRA_API_TOKEN reads a variable you set; cmd: runs a       │      "
"      │                              │            command that prints the token                                  │      "
"      │                              │            Get a token: id.atlassian.com → Security → API tokens          │      "
"      │                              │            Other ways: Storing a token                                    │      "
"      │                              │                                                                           │      "
"      │                              │ JIRA_API_TOKEN isn't set in the shell taskman started from: add export    │      "
"      │                              │ JIRA_API_TOKEN=… to ~/.zshrc, then open a new terminal and start taskman  │      "
"      │                              │ there. Or pick Keychain under Keep in and paste the token there. Fix it,  │      "
"      │                              │ or press Enter again to save anyway.                                      │      "
"      │                              │ Enter save · Tab next field · ←/→ choice · Esc back to list               │      "
